ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang San and Li Si are good brothers. This day, they go to drink and eat skewers. After it ends, Li Si wants to drive home, Zhang San discourages, but Li Si indicates he knows someone in the traffic police team.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Zhang San convince Li Si?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Tell Li Si, even if he knows the traffic police, they can't help him every time.\nB. Express his real worries, like: \"I really worry about you, I don't want to lose my good friend because of this.\"\nC. Remind Li Si, driving after drinking is not only a legal issue, accidents easily happen.\nD. Suggest to rest for a while, then drive home after the alcohol wears off.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035934910704914845,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1bbd6006945d28004ab","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367931266,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e4effb8a961c4503b15e2a9e8624586b"}